273	wysiwyg	\N	f	\N	"{\\n  \\"html\\":\\"\\u0026lt;p\\u0026gt;Sapler a.s. is producer of LDPE/LLDPE/MDPE/HDPE blown films and PP films from virgin as well as from recycled and BIO materials. The films can be produced in different width, length and colors. Films can be printed double-sided with up to 8 colors. We can offer wide variety of films such as – group packaging films, non-shrink film, film with UV protection, antistatic, antiskid and other films. The films can be also sorted based on their shape – double winding, tubular, semi-tubular, with and without side gussets. Films can be used in fields such as food industry, construction, transportation, automotive, agriculture and so on. We can also produce environmentally friendly films with The Blue Angel certification or bags made of biodegradable materials.\\u0026lt;/p\\u0026gt;\\"\\n}\\n"	2018-11-14 13:07:42.758686	2018-11-14 13:14:09.825557
